For decades, rich and powerful interests and their right-wing political allies have been executing a secret plot to buy our political system — and it may get a whole lot worse.

@davidsirota reveals the full story of how we got here, and what we can do to get out of it.

Video

Political corruption is even worse than you think.

To build a functioning one-person-one-vote system where oligarchs don’t pull the strings, we need to make anti-corruption the central focus of our politics.

@davidsirota.com explains why.
